        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ForgeRun</strong> is a fast-paced co-op arena survival game where anyone can become a hero. Battle endless swarms of enemies, gather items and augments, and earn powerful weapons mid-fight to survive as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run, you’ll face waves of enemies, each more relentless than the last. Smash through them, collect gold, and charge totems to create random items that permanently change your build. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve Your Build</strong> – Charge totems on the battlefield to earn random weapons and abilities on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Chaos</strong> – Team up with friends and forge your own builds together as you fight off massive hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swarm Survival</strong> – Battle diverse enemy factions like Goblins, Ice Creatures, and Desert Robots in increasingly chaotic arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold &amp; Glory</strong> – Earn gold from kills to progress through new stages and roll for better items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your team stand the test of the horde… or be crushed by their overwhelming numbers? </p>",
